        "valueString": "No chest pain, orthopnoea, paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnoea, ankle swelling, presyncope, or syncope. No increase in palpitations beyond usual barely noticed flutter; no recent fast heart-rate episodes, dizziness, or increased shortness of breath."
